WEBVTT

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:07.420
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:34.740
For the legendary cookware,

00:01:35.290 --> 00:01:37.310
our team will have a four-round cooking battle

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:38.960
against Dark Cooking Society.

00:01:39.590 --> 00:01:41.470
In the first round of soup battle,

00:01:41.630 --> 00:01:43.400
Luo Ke, from Dark Cooking Society,

00:01:43.480 --> 00:01:45.950
amazingly made the ultimate chicken soup.

00:01:46.610 --> 00:01:48.680
We sent Sanjie first.

00:01:48.760 --> 00:01:50.660
He used a soft-shelled turtle.

00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:53.580
This is my soup.

00:02:06.630 --> 00:02:10.340
What is it? What soup did Sanjie make?

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:15.730
Sanjie Special! Cold Jelly Soup

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:29.650
Are you kidding, brat?

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:31.850
It’s obviously a Hami melon.

00:02:32.030 --> 00:02:34.150
How dare you say it’s soup?

00:02:35.110 --> 00:02:35.810
Sanjie.

00:02:36.430 --> 00:02:38.230
I’ve never heard of

00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:39.190
any melon soup.

00:02:39.460 --> 00:02:40.370
Where was the turtle

00:02:40.420 --> 00:02:41.630
he just used?

00:02:44.170 --> 00:02:45.880
Hey, brat.

00:02:46.420 --> 00:02:47.360
Make it clear.

00:02:47.410 --> 00:02:48.280
What is it?

00:02:48.910 --> 00:02:49.760
Let me go.

00:02:51.420 --> 00:02:53.100
You brat!

00:02:53.740 --> 00:02:55.840
Look, this is

00:02:56.120 --> 00:02:57.790
my Bouncing Soft-shell Turtle Soup.

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:01.120
Bouncing Soft-shell Turtle Soup?

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:04.650
You are exaggerating.

00:03:05.110 --> 00:03:06.540
I think you just

00:03:06.590 --> 00:03:07.410
put your turtle soup

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:08.830
into a melon container.

00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:11.400
I’m gonna bring you the soup,

00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:13.270
leaders.

00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:22.400
Be careful! Don’t drop them!

00:03:22.830 --> 00:03:24.230
Let me help you.

00:03:24.420 --> 00:03:26.160
I can’t stand by and watch.

00:03:27.070 --> 00:03:28.930
You are always careless

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:29.780
and clumsy.

00:03:30.780 --> 00:03:31.700
Thank you, Meili.

00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:39.810
Please enjoy it.

00:03:43.330 --> 00:03:44.940
It... How...

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:49.380
The soup didn’t spill!

00:03:56.510 --> 00:03:57.280
What?

00:03:57.450 --> 00:03:58.280
How is it possible?

00:03:58.470 --> 00:03:59.990
How come the soup doesn’t spill?

00:04:06.070 --> 00:04:08.510
It... The spoon bounced away.

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:14.050
Yes. This is...

00:04:14.370 --> 00:04:16.210
Bouncing Soft-shell Turtle Soup.

00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:16.850
Yes.

00:04:18.430 --> 00:04:19.430
What... What's this?

00:04:21.490 --> 00:04:22.880
The soup is solid!

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:25.410
Exactly.

00:04:26.170 --> 00:04:26.880
What?

00:04:26.970 --> 00:04:28.540
A solid soup?

00:04:29.140 --> 00:04:31.280
It's not a soup that way,

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:32.530
Mao.

00:04:32.970 --> 00:04:35.510
Silang. It’s no doubt a soup.

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:36.790
But...

00:04:37.180 --> 00:04:39.390
That’s fish jelly. The aspic jelly.

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:40.410
Aspic jelly?

00:04:40.690 --> 00:04:41.230
Yes.

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:43.660
It’s the solidified turtle jelly

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:45.270
after cooling down.

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:47.320
I see.

00:04:48.530 --> 00:04:50.270
It turns out to be cold jelly.

00:04:50.610 --> 00:04:52.460
But it’s just some child’s play

00:04:52.510 --> 00:04:54.070
to draw attention.

00:04:59.270 --> 00:05:00.940
Is this soup?

00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:04.140
I’ve never had a chewing soup.

00:05:06.340 --> 00:05:07.850
The slightly salty taste.

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:10.280
What is the sour taste?

00:05:26.100 --> 00:05:27.940
Just tell us, Sanjie.

00:05:28.810 --> 00:05:31.260
How did you make this strange soup?

00:05:31.570 --> 00:05:34.160
First, I cooked the turtle,

00:05:34.320 --> 00:05:35.260
boiled it in water,

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:37.310
removed impurities and seasoned with salt.

00:05:38.170 --> 00:05:40.550
Then I poured it into emptied melons

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:41.830
and steamed the soup

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:42.780
with the melon in a steamer.

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:43.790
This way, the turtle’s earthy

00:05:43.830 --> 00:05:45.750
and fishy smell disappeared.

00:05:46.620 --> 00:05:47.260
Then it was cooled down

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:49.510
and the soup inside solidified.

00:05:49.830 --> 00:05:51.630
So, the flavor of the turtle

00:05:51.680 --> 00:05:53.220
was fully locked in soup.

00:05:53.890 --> 00:05:55.790
Why did you select a soft-shelled turtle?

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:56.500
Yes.

00:05:56.840 --> 00:05:58.110
Because, of all the meat,

00:05:58.350 --> 00:05:59.440
the turtle’s collagen

00:05:59.600 --> 00:06:02.640
is far more than any other ingredients.

00:06:04.740 --> 00:06:06.230
What about the sour taste?

00:06:06.370 --> 00:06:06.830
Yes.

00:06:07.140 --> 00:06:08.200
The sour taste is from

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:09.580
Zhejiang’s specialty,

00:06:09.670 --> 00:06:10.880
pickled plums.

00:06:11.710 --> 00:06:12.430
I see.

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:14.900
So it’s from pickled plums.

00:06:16.650 --> 00:06:18.000
Brat, looks like you have no idea

00:06:18.050 --> 00:06:19.650
about soup at all.

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:22.050
Soup is not

00:06:22.100 --> 00:06:24.090
a support role in cooking.

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:25.810
It’s a soup,

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:27.340
but it should satisfy

00:06:27.390 --> 00:06:27.970
those who eat

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:30.300
only with the soup itself.

00:06:30.560 --> 00:06:32.900
A jelly soup of picked plums?

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:35.400
It's just a side dish.

00:06:35.650 --> 00:06:37.720
It is not a true soup!

00:06:40.490 --> 00:06:41.680
Compared with their look

00:06:41.730 --> 00:06:43.490
when they gobbled my soup,

00:06:44.940 --> 00:06:46.470
your soup is much worse.

00:06:46.510 --> 00:06:48.250
From the looks of the leaders,

00:06:48.460 --> 00:06:49.920
we can know the result already.

00:06:50.150 --> 00:06:52.480
The outcome is already out.

00:06:58.040 --> 00:07:01.280
Now we’ll announce the result.

00:07:01.840 --> 00:07:03.980
Raise the white spoon if you choose Luo Ke,

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:07.240
and the red spoon for Sanjie.

00:07:07.630 --> 00:07:09.550
Leaders, please raise your spoon

00:07:09.600 --> 00:07:12.230
for the contestant you favor.

00:07:13.580 --> 00:07:14.630
Sanjie.

00:07:15.420 --> 00:07:16.270
Not good.

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:19.290
Does Sanjie feel too pressured?

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:21.330
Luo Ke, the Tiger.

00:07:22.010 --> 00:07:23.170
He got his position

00:07:23.220 --> 00:07:24.840
by his soup skills only,

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:26.570
a soup expert of Dark Cooking Society.

00:07:27.240 --> 00:07:28.560
His unrivalled techniques,

00:07:28.900 --> 00:07:30.520
the top soup cooked with best ingredients,

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:37.300
the good taste is not something

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:38.450
Sanjie can compete with.

00:07:40.050 --> 00:07:40.660
Lei En.

00:07:43.080 --> 00:07:45.070
But when it comes to Sanjie’s

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:46.140
creativity,

00:07:46.340 --> 00:07:48.180
he may still stand a chance.

00:07:48.310 --> 00:07:50.030
Basics and creativity.

00:07:50.460 --> 00:07:52.260
It's a complete contrast of them.

00:07:52.550 --> 00:07:54.910
But the judges seemed to prefer

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:57.710
Luo Ke’s soup.

00:08:02.630 --> 00:08:03.360
Sanjie.

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:12.130
There’s no need to compare.

00:08:12.330 --> 00:08:13.040
Right.

00:08:19.710 --> 00:08:20.890
Now announce the result.

00:08:24.690 --> 00:08:30.610
Sanjie.

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:33.120
What?

00:08:34.470 --> 00:08:35.940
Great!

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:37.940
It’s great!

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:40.320
How is it possible? Darn it.

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:43.600
Why?

00:08:43.850 --> 00:08:45.680
Weren’t you more pleased

00:08:45.730 --> 00:08:47.700
with my soup?

00:08:48.940 --> 00:08:49.630
Luo Ke.

00:08:50.110 --> 00:08:52.330
You forgot an important point.

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:54.290
What is it?

00:08:55.530 --> 00:08:56.400
The theme of this battle

00:08:56.450 --> 00:08:58.350
is banquet cooking.

00:08:59.740 --> 00:09:02.110
The first dish of the menu, the soup,

00:09:02.290 --> 00:09:03.280
should be not only delicious,

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:05.010
but also

00:09:05.050 --> 00:09:06.160
be related to the next dish.

00:09:06.670 --> 00:09:08.060
The next dish?

00:09:08.650 --> 00:09:11.810
Your soup is indeed rich and mellow.

00:09:11.890 --> 00:09:12.980
It’s unrivalled.

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:14.960
But its taste is too good

00:09:15.010 --> 00:09:15.870
to eat at first.

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:21.870
If the first dish is so thick,

00:09:22.150 --> 00:09:22.910
people will not be able to

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:23.960
have the following dishes.

00:09:32.810 --> 00:09:33.950
There’s so much left.

00:09:34.270 --> 00:09:35.660
How could my soup...

00:09:36.940 --> 00:09:37.870
Darn it.

00:09:37.920 --> 00:09:38.650
Sanjie’s soup

00:09:38.700 --> 00:09:42.420
doesn’t taste special at first.

00:09:43.710 --> 00:09:44.520
But when you keep eating,

00:09:44.570 --> 00:09:45.690
it’ll feel slightly salty.

00:09:45.950 --> 00:09:48.140
The elegant and perfect taste of turtle

00:09:48.340 --> 00:09:50.650
will spread in mouth.

00:09:51.720 --> 00:09:54.380
Yes. The jelly-like soup

00:09:55.070 --> 00:09:57.500
fills your mouth when you chew.

00:09:58.620 --> 00:10:00.100
And the sourness of plums

00:10:00.150 --> 00:10:01.170
can stimulate the appetite.

00:10:04.570 --> 00:10:05.820
This soup

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:07.580
can’t be better

00:10:07.630 --> 00:10:08.950
as the first dish.

00:10:09.030 --> 00:10:10.370
You brat!

00:10:10.950 --> 00:10:11.470
Yes.

00:10:12.220 --> 00:10:13.890
You do know a lot.

00:10:14.230 --> 00:10:15.670
You’re absolutely correct.

00:10:16.190 --> 00:10:17.200
We are now eager

00:10:17.250 --> 00:10:18.550
for the next dish.

00:10:18.830 --> 00:10:20.030
I have a great appetite.

00:10:23.040 --> 00:10:23.880
Yes.

00:10:27.110 --> 00:10:27.880
It’s all eaten.

00:10:30.110 --> 00:10:31.700
They all ate it up!

00:10:32.580 --> 00:10:33.880
I didn’t see him wrong.

00:10:33.950 --> 00:10:35.950
Sanjie, you did great.

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:37.970
That’s not

00:10:38.020 --> 00:10:39.030
what you said just now.

00:10:39.080 --> 00:10:39.690
Chef Xie.

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:41.310
Ignore that.

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:43.000
Being so petty won’t

00:10:43.060 --> 00:10:44.870
make you a good chef.

00:10:45.750 --> 00:10:47.230
What is it to do with me?

00:10:48.830 --> 00:10:51.140
A chewing Bouncing Soft-shell Turtle Soup

00:10:51.620 --> 00:10:54.190
perfectly breaks the tradition.

00:10:54.390 --> 00:10:55.650
You are really amazing.

00:10:56.750 --> 00:10:58.070
Thank you very much.

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:02.280
We got the first win.

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:05.300
No way.

00:11:05.630 --> 00:11:06.270
I am Luo Ke.

00:11:06.320 --> 00:11:08.560
How can I lose to that brat?

00:11:10.760 --> 00:11:11.750
Sanjie.

00:11:13.100 --> 00:11:14.280
Great!

00:11:14.550 --> 00:11:15.480
You did a great job.

00:11:16.910 --> 00:11:17.650
Sanjie.

00:11:18.910 --> 00:11:19.970
How did I do?

00:11:20.340 --> 00:11:22.360
Did I make any progress?

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:23.300
Sanjie.

00:11:23.960 --> 00:11:25.280
You still remember

00:11:25.730 --> 00:11:27.220
the tradition of Yang Spring Restaurant.

00:11:27.300 --> 00:11:28.360
Of course.

00:11:28.770 --> 00:11:30.320
The tradition of Yang Spring Restaurant

00:11:30.760 --> 00:11:31.260
is…

00:11:31.570 --> 00:11:32.340
…to break…

00:11:33.100 --> 00:11:34.380
…traditions.

00:11:36.930 --> 00:11:38.400
Great!

00:11:41.540 --> 00:11:43.310
Isn’t it too early to celebrate?

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:45.690
It’s just the beginning.

00:11:46.380 --> 00:11:47.220
This is getting

00:11:47.270 --> 00:11:48.540
more interesting.

00:11:54.960 --> 00:11:56.920
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:11:57.610 --> 00:11:58.660
Let’s keep it up

00:11:58.700 --> 00:11:59.890
and win three battles in a row.

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:02.390
I lost.

00:12:02.800 --> 00:12:04.740
I am Multicoloured Tiger Luo Ke.

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:06.390
I lost to a nobody.

00:12:19.650 --> 00:12:20.720
For Dark Cooking Society,

00:12:20.770 --> 00:12:22.130
failure is a sin

00:12:22.190 --> 00:12:24.670
that must be redeemed with death.

00:12:28.400 --> 00:12:29.120
Wait!

00:12:31.460 --> 00:12:33.550
No! Don’t! Stop it!

00:12:34.170 --> 00:12:34.750
Please.

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:36.650
Please give me another chance.

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:38.690
I’ll leave you

00:12:38.830 --> 00:12:40.440
the sign of losers, “the Unpalatable”.

00:12:40.720 --> 00:12:42.180
You should hone your skills

00:12:42.230 --> 00:12:43.520
with this pain.

00:12:44.690 --> 00:12:45.530
Hold on.

00:12:47.090 --> 00:12:48.430
Please stop it.

00:13:02.410 --> 00:13:02.970
You can’t live

00:13:03.020 --> 00:13:05.230
as a chef anymore.

00:13:08.380 --> 00:13:09.540
All you have now

00:13:09.770 --> 00:13:11.840
is the disgraceful “Unpalatable” sign.

00:13:11.840 --> 00:13:13.160
(Unpalatable)

00:13:13.160 --> 00:13:16.250
(It means too awful to eat)

00:13:22.280 --> 00:13:24.550
The second round of the competition

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:25.630
is about dim sum.

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:27.720
Decide who you will send.

00:13:33.170 --> 00:13:34.690
Are you blind or something?

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:35.620
Who else could go

00:13:35.670 --> 00:13:36.330
if not me?

00:13:49.120 --> 00:13:50.500
Let me, the Number One Dim Sum Chef,

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:52.710
Steel Bar Xie Lu to deal with you.

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:55.470
Yes! Show them what you’ve got, Chef Xie!

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:57.050
Chef Xie! We count on you!

00:14:02.600 --> 00:14:04.710
Are you the famous Super Dim Sum Chef,

00:14:04.950 --> 00:14:06.010
Steel Bar Xie Lu?

00:14:07.020 --> 00:14:09.670
It will be easy to win this battle.

00:14:10.140 --> 00:14:11.080
No one

00:14:11.130 --> 00:14:12.000
can make better dim sum

00:14:12.050 --> 00:14:13.810
than Chef Xie!

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:17.720
Who? Who is it?

00:14:18.020 --> 00:14:20.250
Who is so unlucky to be my opponent?

00:14:23.620 --> 00:14:25.580
Don’t bluff.

00:14:27.910 --> 00:14:29.380
In sight of you,

00:14:29.650 --> 00:14:30.490
it reminds me

00:14:30.530 --> 00:14:31.910
of my old days.

00:14:33.670 --> 00:14:35.080
Will you compete with me?

00:14:35.490 --> 00:14:36.390
Be careful.

00:14:36.440 --> 00:14:37.410
Don’t push yourself

00:14:37.460 --> 00:14:38.380
or you’ll lose your breath.

00:14:39.550 --> 00:14:40.810
Now

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:41.910
just say whatever you want.

00:14:44.510 --> 00:14:45.960
The emblem symbolizes the Bailuo family.

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:47.430
What? The Bailuo family?

00:14:48.260 --> 00:14:50.170
Lei En, what is the Bailuo family?

00:14:50.760 --> 00:14:51.620
The Bailuo family traces back

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:55.290
to the Three Kingdoms period,

00:14:55.340 --> 00:14:56.330
the dim sum family

00:14:56.750 --> 00:15:00.890
who served Zhuge Kongming.

00:15:01.980 --> 00:15:03.340
It’s said their ancestor

00:15:03.390 --> 00:15:04.710
served the dim sum

00:15:05.200 --> 00:15:07.510
that was used as tribute

00:15:07.730 --> 00:15:09.030
to pacify the raging river

00:15:09.080 --> 00:15:10.960
which stopped Kongming’s army.

00:15:13.020 --> 00:15:13.760
In other words,

00:15:14.340 --> 00:15:15.450
all the techniques

00:15:15.960 --> 00:15:18.150
of China’s dim sum nowadays

00:15:18.900 --> 00:15:20.580
originated from the Bailuo family.

00:15:21.130 --> 00:15:22.820
It’s a legendary dim sum family.

00:15:24.630 --> 00:15:25.800
But I heard that, 50 years ago,

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:27.390
Pastry King Luogen

00:15:27.430 --> 00:15:28.450
was already the last of the family.

00:15:28.920 --> 00:15:30.920
The family line was broken, wasn’t it?

00:15:31.990 --> 00:15:33.170
Pastry King?

00:15:36.250 --> 00:15:37.940
Old man. Are you...

00:15:38.320 --> 00:15:39.360
Yes.

00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:41.260
Even in Dark Cooking Society,

00:15:41.310 --> 00:15:42.900
few people know my true identify.

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:46.330
I’m the last of the Bailuo family,

00:15:46.680 --> 00:15:48.750
Pastry King Luogen.

00:15:53.580 --> 00:15:54.850
How is that possible?

00:15:55.350 --> 00:15:57.120
A legendary pastry master,

00:15:57.170 --> 00:15:58.050
whose skill

00:15:58.100 --> 00:16:00.080
was even praised

00:16:00.440 --> 00:16:01.630
by the emperor,

00:16:01.680 --> 00:16:02.580
is right here.

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:09.110
Didn’t he die

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:10.890
50 years ago?

00:16:11.100 --> 00:16:11.740
Yes.

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:13.080
If he were still alive,

00:16:13.130 --> 00:16:14.500
he should’ve been over 100.

00:16:14.890 --> 00:16:15.520
Why?

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:16.950
All the dim sum masters

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:18.170
want to be like you.

00:16:18.310 --> 00:16:19.880
Why do you join Dark Cooking Society?

00:16:21.390 --> 00:16:22.730
Isn’t it simple?

00:16:22.820 --> 00:16:24.040
Because there are

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:26.310
many secret techniques I don’t know here.

00:16:26.490 --> 00:16:28.260
I come to learn.

00:16:28.900 --> 00:16:30.990
Now I’m skilled at both.

00:16:31.100 --> 00:16:33.260
A young man like you will not be my match

00:16:33.450 --> 00:16:35.320
even in 100 years.

00:16:40.990 --> 00:16:41.700
That is...

00:16:42.210 --> 00:16:44.370
What is that old man doing?

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:07.970
That’s a noodle!

00:17:08.350 --> 00:17:09.440
He keeps it

00:17:09.490 --> 00:17:10.940
as a whole strand.

00:17:11.660 --> 00:17:12.330
Awesome.

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:14.050
Ordinary people can never do that.

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:24.350
Soul Repose Noodles.

00:17:24.440 --> 00:17:27.110
It even soothed Emperor Qianlong’s anger,

00:17:27.340 --> 00:17:28.680
with one strand

00:17:28.720 --> 00:17:31.080
that fills a whole bowl.

00:17:33.890 --> 00:17:35.040
What an amazing technique.

00:17:35.090 --> 00:17:36.920
He made the legendary noodle so fast.

00:17:37.100 --> 00:17:38.890
Is he really over 100 years old?

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:40.650
All dim sum chefs

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:42.510
have their own stick.

00:17:42.810 --> 00:17:44.270
That crutch must be Luogen’s.

00:17:50.950 --> 00:17:51.600
Chef Xie.

00:17:52.970 --> 00:17:53.880
Like in the past,

00:17:53.930 --> 00:17:56.270
our Bailuo family’s dim sum

00:17:56.680 --> 00:17:59.130
could pacify a raging river.

00:17:59.940 --> 00:18:01.950
Dim sum should be able to

00:18:02.540 --> 00:18:04.360
pacify the fluctuation

00:18:04.410 --> 00:18:05.680
of emotions.

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:07.300
It's the so-called Soul Repose.

00:18:07.630 --> 00:18:09.040
Eat it without cutting.

00:18:09.170 --> 00:18:10.340
Pacify the mind

00:18:10.490 --> 00:18:12.520
and even bless the soldiers.

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:16.140
This is a return gift, old man.

00:18:19.510 --> 00:18:20.140
Hot.

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:23.260
This... This is...

00:18:24.650 --> 00:18:25.930
The essence of dumpling technique.

00:18:26.650 --> 00:18:27.720
Crown Dumplings.

00:18:28.340 --> 00:18:29.110
Mao.

00:18:29.380 --> 00:18:30.930
What is Crown Dumplings?

00:18:31.410 --> 00:18:32.600
They are steamed dumplings

00:18:32.650 --> 00:18:34.940
finely made with two kinds of skins.

00:18:35.220 --> 00:18:36.480
Chef Xie deserves his name.

00:18:37.870 --> 00:18:40.270
When did you make this?

00:18:40.370 --> 00:18:41.420
What soul repose?

00:18:41.560 --> 00:18:43.180
You are such a stubborn geezer.

00:18:43.530 --> 00:18:44.410
What?

00:18:46.780 --> 00:18:48.400
(State of mind, change)
Dim sum should be able to change

00:18:48.450 --> 00:18:49.140
(Dim sum)
the state of mind.

00:18:49.390 --> 00:18:49.950
In other words,

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:52.530
dim sum should make people

00:18:52.580 --> 00:18:53.910
have a good mood.

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:55.550
Just feel free

00:18:55.670 --> 00:18:57.180
and enjoy the Crown Dumplings.

00:18:59.170 --> 00:19:00.690
Take it easy, old man.

00:19:04.960 --> 00:19:07.740
Dim sum should be fancy.

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:08.850
That would be more interesting.

00:19:09.920 --> 00:19:10.690
Mao.

00:19:10.740 --> 00:19:12.640
Chef Xie is really good.

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:14.480
Yes, he is a true master.

00:19:16.820 --> 00:19:18.690
He knows who I am but isn’t afraid.

00:19:18.840 --> 00:19:20.840
Looks like I’ve got a big target.

00:19:24.510 --> 00:19:25.420
The second round.

00:19:25.630 --> 00:19:27.290
The battle of dim sum begins.

00:19:38.980 --> 00:19:39.560
Mao.

00:19:40.060 --> 00:19:41.380
It’s a contest of dim sum.

00:19:41.430 --> 00:19:42.640
But there are many kinds, right?

00:19:43.520 --> 00:19:46.250
Dim sum also means snacks.

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:47.500
Like dumplings,

00:19:48.560 --> 00:19:49.380
Shumai,

00:19:50.490 --> 00:19:51.190
wonton,

00:19:52.570 --> 00:19:53.320
steamed buns,

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:55.330
Spring Rolls,

00:19:56.300 --> 00:19:57.750
noodles, cakes, etc.

00:19:58.340 --> 00:19:59.710
It covers many things.

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:01.210
Look, what is that?

00:20:14.900 --> 00:20:15.750
A dart wheel?

00:20:15.930 --> 00:20:16.500
Yes.

00:20:16.570 --> 00:20:17.430
She will use it to decide

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:18.590
which category to compete.

00:20:20.890 --> 00:20:22.320
The category

00:20:22.370 --> 00:20:24.020
will be decided by fate.

00:20:24.640 --> 00:20:26.460
Chef Xie, it’s your call.

00:20:27.130 --> 00:20:28.640
What do you think, Luogen?

00:20:29.050 --> 00:20:30.220
I certainly agree.

00:20:30.640 --> 00:20:31.350
Try to choose

00:20:31.670 --> 00:20:33.790
what you are good at.

00:20:35.690 --> 00:20:37.050
Do you think I am

00:20:37.100 --> 00:20:38.220
that narrow-minded?

00:20:39.270 --> 00:20:41.960
Moreover, it’s not in my control.

00:20:42.960 --> 00:20:45.650
Okay. Anything will be fine with me.

00:20:46.920 --> 00:20:48.300
Please hit Shumai.

00:20:48.350 --> 00:20:50.870
Come on! You must hit Shumai!

00:20:56.880 --> 00:20:58.280
What is it? What did he hit?

00:20:58.330 --> 00:20:59.810
Dumplings? Noodles or Spring Rolls?

00:21:01.450 --> 00:21:04.110
Shumai.

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:14.230
The category is decided.

00:21:14.280 --> 00:21:15.100
Steamed buns.

00:21:16.910 --> 00:21:18.850
Chef Xie is good at this as well.

00:21:18.890 --> 00:21:19.700
Silang. Meili.

00:21:19.900 --> 00:21:20.640
Not good.

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:22.610
The least expected category

00:21:22.660 --> 00:21:24.280
was hit.

00:21:25.290 --> 00:21:26.640
Why, Lei En?

00:21:27.780 --> 00:21:29.190
Steamed buns were

00:21:29.650 --> 00:21:31.580
invented by the ancestors of Bailuo.

00:21:33.600 --> 00:21:35.060
That’s to say, no one

00:21:35.700 --> 00:21:36.800
is better than the Bailuo family

00:21:36.850 --> 00:21:38.030
in the techniques.

00:23:15.059 --> 00:23:17.061
Preview of the next episode

00:23:17.755 --> 00:23:18.591
It's not good.

00:23:18.786 --> 00:23:21.139
Of all others, the Chinese steamed bun becomes an issue.

00:23:21.455 --> 00:23:23.486
What's more, what Luogen took out

00:23:23.486 --> 00:23:26.631
was a horrifying secret weapon that
had been alive for 1,600 years.

00:23:27.255 --> 00:23:28.612
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:28.959 --> 00:23:30.420
The Pastry King Luogen:

00:23:30.420 --> 00:23:32.929
1,600 Year-Old Spirit-Calming Chinese Steamed Bun

00:23:33.172 --> 00:23:34.388
It will definitely be interesting!
